<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2084] z.show doesn&apos;t show dataframe</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2084</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;I am doing &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;z.show(sc.parallelize((1 to 1000000).toList).toDF, 100000)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;and it doesn&apos;t show anything. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After browser page refresh it shows everything correctly. I tried it on Chrome and Safari and it doesn&apos;t looks like it is browser related.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;if i use number less that 100000 it works correctly. For my custom DF it works only if i specify number less that 100&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In Chrome developer tool i can see exceptions in javascript when i am trying to execute code above&lt;/p&gt;
